5,1,1,talk,Minato,,Hello everyone. I want to make sure we can actually finish the work on time. I would like to look into the regional firms tendering for earth-moving and the depot phasing notes on hoarding the site.,"{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,May,,I'll be the one keeping an eye on the wallet! I'm curious about the upkeep ledger spend per hectare and the groundskeeping roll and bought-in services. Let's see where the money actually goes.,"{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Shizue,,It is so lovely to meet you all. I want to ensure our choices truly last for the children. I shall look into the condition of works from the earlier programme and the record of the eastern avenue planting.,"{""words"":39,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Victoria,,"I agree that we must consider the long-term management of the site. I will look into the groundskeeping roll and bought-in services, as well as the volunteer groups working with the division.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,I'll focus on the practicalities of how the site is actually used and handled. I'll look into the timed counts of weekday crossings and the drainage callouts and August heat readings.,"{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,pass,Minato,,Skip,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,May,,"Does anyone else have a particular curiosity they haven't mentioned? I feel like we've covered the basics, but I'm open to suggestions if we're missing a blind spot!","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Shizue,,I think we have a very thoughtful variety of interests. It is wonderful to see such a balanced approach to our little park. I am quite content with my choices.,"{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Victoria,,"I believe we have a comprehensive spread. By examining both the official staffing and the volunteer contributions, I hope to clarify who will actually be maintaining the space.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Shunichi,,"I'm satisfied. We have the finances, the labor, the history, and the physical constraints covered. Let's just get to the data so we can stop guessing.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,pass,Minato,,Skip,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,May,,"I'm just as eager as you are, Shunichi! Let's get to the numbers and see if we can find a plan that doesn't break the bank in a few years.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Shizue,,I agree. It is always better to be sure of the foundation before we build our dreams. I look forward to hearing what you all discover.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Victoria,,"I concur. Once we have the facts, we can move from general concerns to a concrete decision. I am ready to proceed.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Shunichi,,"Since we're all in agreement and the roles are set, I'll pass. Let's move to the findings.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Minato,,I agree with everyone. I'm looking forward to seeing what we find out together.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
